	<entry>
		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Requete Gap replication Standby]]></title>
		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=26992#p26992"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Bonjour ,<br />&#160; &#160;Je cherche une requête , si c&#039;est possible, qui envoie&#160; le même résultat que&#160; &quot;show pool_nodes;&quot;&#160; ou une requête qui envoie le Gap de la replication Standby </p><p> <br />postgres=&gt; show pool_nodes;<br /> node_id | hostname | port | status | lb_weight |&#160; role&#160; &#160;| select_cnt | load_balance_node | replication_delay<br />---------+----------+------+--------+-----------+---------+------------+-------------------+-------------------<br /> 0&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;| osspc19&#160; | 5432 | down&#160; &#160;| 0.500000&#160; | standby | 0&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; | false&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;| 0<br /> 1&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;| osspc20&#160; | 5432 | up&#160; &#160; &#160;| 0.500000&#160; | primary | 0&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; | true&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; | 0</p><br /><p>Merci d&#039;avance </p><p>Djam</p>]]></content>
